News Anchor : All cats can rest easy at home today, knowing that [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size] is the hero of humans, plants, and pets alike!
News Anchor : Nature seems to have returned to normal, and to celebrate, the city decided to bring in a circus full of wonders for everyone to enjoy.
do OverlayUI.go_to_next_scene()
News Anchor: One of the many wonders is getting to meet the great [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#adc4ff]Spinamo[/color][/wave][/outline_size], who will be outside the circus to greet all the children.
News Anchor: On top of that, our hero wants to try to prevent one of the worst tragedies that can happen to anyone who visits the circus...
News Anchor: [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=15.0 connected=0][color=#ef604a]ACCIDENTLY LETTING GO OF THEIR BALLOON!!![/color][/wave][/outline_size]
News Anchor: Good thing our clever friend is always prepared—this time with [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#ef604a]rockets[/color][/wave][/outline_size] that let him [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#ef604a]fly[/color][/wave][/outline_size] and [outline_size=10][wave amp=50.0 freq=5.0 connected=0][color=#19baff]reach[/color][/wave][/outline_size] all the loose balloons before they touch the clouds!.
News Anchor : For everyone who decided to enjoy the circus from the comfort of their own home, stay with us and let's watch another act of kindness from our dear friend.
